            f"\n\nThe following deprecated CLI flags were used: {', '.join(deprecated_flags)}!\n"
            "Please see the 5.0.0 upgrade guide:\n"
            "\thttps://timothycrosley.github.io/isort/docs/upgrade_guides/5.0.0/\n"
        )

